From d56f3752c1e9b60f8979156d1bfc300e20cc23dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavle012 <pavle@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:23:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add offline accounts

Adds username-only offline accounts alongside Microsoft accounts.
Offline accounts are stored in minecraft_users with a marker in
refresh_token (no DB migration), skip token refresh and Mojang profile
lookups, use the vanilla OfflinePlayer UUID, launch with user_type
legacy, and skip the Mojang session join.
